# Words sent while the agent's answer to the first comes out of its avatar (emit.mbt): the second words' flight
# against that motion.
timeout 30000
until 发消息
wait 600
tap 发消息
wait 500
type 先看一下列表
wait 500
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 400
tap 发消息
wait 300
type 再看一下按钮
wait 1500
tap icon:arrow-up
wait 3500
